Changes for ha-eheim include bundled relative imports, filter operating-time,
pause, error, estimated-flow and estimated-power sensors, complete English and
German translations, connection cleanup during configuration, redacted
diagnostics, packet logging without payloads, and type-checking corrections.
The Apache-2.0 license applies to the ha-eheim integration changes.
The embedded protocol package retains its MIT license.

The JSON integration metadata, icons and translations are adapted from the
same Home Assistant integration. This custom integration is maintained by
hilman2 and is not an official EHEIM or Home Assistant release.

Version 0.2.0 introduces the standalone eheimdigital_plus domain, confirmed
legacy migration, connection and per-device availability handling, optional
LED controls and HA Gold criteria documentation. The quality assessment is
maintained by this project and is not an official Home Assistant Core rating.
